\\"appropriation\\\", \\\"severity\\\": \\\"high\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Planning without prices becomes infrastructural coordination\\\", \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Benanav imports Neurath's non-price planning premise and turns it into an infrastructural coordination thesis.\\\", \\\"target_document_label\\\": \\\"Beyond Capitalism 2\\\", \\\"target_quote\\\": \\\"Coordination can be designed without handing the task back to prices.\\\", \\\"source_work_title\\\": \\\"Economic Plan and Calculation in Kind\\\", \\\"source_quote\\\": \\\"The economic plan can proceed in kind without price calculation.\\\", \\\"discrepancy_analysis\\\": \\\"The borrowing is strong, but Benanav updates the vocabulary to contemporary platform coordination.\\\", \\\"implication_for_argument\\\": \\\"This keeps planning legible after the critique of market socialism.\\\"}, {\\\"theme_id\\\": \\\"theme_calculation_without_prices\\\", \\\"theme_name\\\": \\\"Calculation Without Prices\\\", \\\"sin_type\\\": \\\"appropriation\\\", \\\"severity\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"War-economy coordination is rewritten as systems design\\\", \\\"summary\\\": \\\"A wartime planning argument is reformulated as a general systems-design problem.\\\", \\\"target_document_label\\\": \\\"Beyond Capitalism 2\\\", \\\"target_quote\\\": \\\"Large-scale coordination is a design problem, not a market miracle.\\\", \\\"source_work_title\\\": \\\"Through War Economy to Economy in Kind\\\", \\\"source_quote\\\": \\\"War economy demonstrates directed allocation beyond market exchange.\\\", \\\"discrepancy_analysis\\\": \\\"Benanav abstracts away from the wartime setting while preserving the planning lesson.\\\", \\\"implication_for_argument\\\": \\\"It lets him universalize a historically bounded planning example.\\\"}, {\\\"theme_id\\\": \\\"theme_calculation_without_prices\\\", \\\"theme_name\\\": \\\"Calculation Without Prices\\\", \\\"sin_type\\\": \\\"misreading\\\", \\\"severity\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"ti